#. Description
#: Package: binutils-gold-x86-64-linux-gnux32 Package:
#: binutils-gold-x86-64-linux-gnu Package: binutils-gold-sparc64-linux-gnu
#: Package: binutils-gold-sparc-linux-gnu Package:
#: binutils-gold-s390x-linux-gnu Package: binutils-gold-powerpc64le-linux-gnu
