#. Summary
#: Package: cpp-15-x86-64-linux-gnu
msgid "GNU C preprocessor for x86_64-linux-gnu"
msgstr "GNU C-preprocessor för x86_64-linux-gnu"

#. Description
#: Package: cpp-15-x86-64-linux-gnu Package: cpp-15-s390x-linux-gnu Package:
#: cpp-15-riscv64-linux-gnu Package: cpp-15-powerpc64le-linux-gnu Package:
