#. Summary
#: Package: cpp-doc Package: cpp-15-doc
msgid "Documentation for the GNU C preprocessor (cpp)"
msgstr "Dokumentation för GNU C-preprocessorn (cpp)"

#. Description
#: Package: cpp-doc
msgid ""
"Documentation for the GNU C preprocessor in info format (dependency "
