#. Description
#: Package: libavahi-compat-libdnssd1
msgid ""
"This library contains the Apple Bonjour compatibility library of Avahi."
msgstr ""
"Detta bibliotek innehåller Apples Bonjour-kompatibilitetsbibliotek från "
"Avahi."

#. Summary
#: Package: libavahi-core-dev
msgid "Development files for Avahi's embeddable mDNS/DNS-SD library"
msgstr "Utvecklingsfiler för Avahis inbäddade mDNS/DNS-SD-bibliotek"

#. Description
#: Package: libavahi-core-dev
msgid ""
"This package contains the development files for Avahi's embeddable mDNS/DNS-"
"SD stack. This can be used by embedded application developers to integrate "
"mDNS/DNS-SD functionality into their applications."
msgstr ""
"Detta paket innehåller utvecklingsfilerna för Avahis inbäddade mDNS/DNS-SD-"
"stack. Detta kan användas av utvecklare av inbäddade applikationer för att "
"integrera mDNS/DNS-SD-funktionalitet i sina applikationer."

#. Description
#: Package: libavahi-core-dev
msgid ""
"You should not however use this library for non-embedded applications, you "
"should use libavahi-client-dev which interacts with the avahi daemon."
msgstr ""
"Du bör dock inte använda detta bibliotek för icke-inbäddade applikationer, "
"utan istället använda libavahi-client-dev som interagerar med avahi-demonen."

#. Summary
#: Package: libavahi-core7
msgid "Avahi's embeddable mDNS/DNS-SD library"
msgstr "Avahis inbäddade mDNS/DNS-SD-bibliotek"

#. Description
#: Package: libavahi-core7
msgid ""
"This package contains the library for Avahi's embeddable mDNS/DNS-SD stack. "
"This can be used by embedded applications to integrate mDNS/DNS-SD "
"functionality into their applications."
msgstr ""
"Detta paket innehåller biblioteket för Avahis inbäddade mDNS/DNS-SD-stack. "
"Detta kan användas av inbäddade applikationer för att integrera mDNS/DNS-SD-"
"funktionalitet i sina applikationer."

#. Description
#: Package: libavahi-core7
msgid ""
"You should not however use this library for non-embedded applications, you "
"should use libavahi-client which interacts with the avahi daemon."
msgstr ""
"Du bör dock inte använda detta bibliotek för icke-inbäddade applikationer, "
"utan istället använda libavahi-client som interagerar med avahi-demonen."

#. Summary
#: Package: libavahi-glib-dev
msgid "Development headers for the Avahi GLib integration library"
msgstr "Utvecklingsrubriker för Avahi GLib-integrationsbiblioteket"

#. Description
#: Package: libavahi-glib-dev
msgid ""
"This package contains the development headers for the interface to integrate"
" the Avahi libraries  into a GLib main loop application, including GTK+ "
"applications."
msgstr ""
"Detta paket innehåller utvecklingsrubrikerna för gränssnittet för att "
"integrera Avahi-biblioteken i en GLib-huvudloopapplikation, inklusive "
"GTK+-applikationer."

#. Summary
#: Package: libavahi-glib1
msgid "Avahi GLib integration library"
msgstr "Avahi GLib-integrationsbibliotek"

#. Description
#: Package: libavahi-glib1
msgid ""
"This library contains the interface to integrate the Avahi libraries into a "
"GLib main loop application, including GTK+ applications."
msgstr ""
"Detta bibliotek innehåller gränssnittet för att integrera Avahi-biblioteken "
"i en GLib-huvudloopapplikation, inklusive GTK+-applikationer."

#. Summary
#: Package: libavahi-gobject-dev
msgid "Development headers for the Avahi GObject library"
msgstr "Utvecklingsrubriker för Avahi GObject-biblioteket"

#. Description
