"against GTK-3+."
msgstr ""
"Detta paket innehåller delade bibliotek som ska användas av applikationer "
"som kompilerats mot GTK-3+."

#. Summary
#: Package: libayatana-appindicator3-dev
msgid "Ayatana Application Indicators (development files, GTK-3+ version)"
msgstr "Ayatana-applikationsindikatorer (utvecklingsfiler, GTK-3+-version)"

#. Description
#: Package: libayatana-appindicator3-dev Package: libayatana-appindicator3-1
#: Package: libayatana-appindicator-doc Package:
