msgstr "Detta paket innehåller själva biblioteket (GTK-3+-variant)."

#. Summary
#: Package: libayatana-indicator3-dev
msgid "panel indicator applet - library development files (GTK-3+)"
msgstr "panelindikatorapplet - biblioteksutvecklingsfiler (GTK-3+)"

#. Description
#: Package: libayatana-indicator3-dev Package: libayatana-indicator3-7
msgid ""
"The Ayatana Indicators library contains information to build indicators to "
