#. Summary
#: Package: libblockdev-dm3
msgid "Device Mapper plugin for libblockdev"
msgstr "Device Mapper-plugin för libblockdev"

#. Description
#: Package: libblockdev-dm3
msgid ""
"The libblockdev library plugin (and at the same time a standalone library) "
