#. Summary
#: Package: libmirplatform34
msgid "Mir Display Server - platform library"
msgstr "Mir Display Server – plattformsbibliotek"

#. Description
#: Package: libmirplatform34
msgid ""
"Contains the shared libraries required for the Mir server to interact with "
