#. Summary
#: Package: libpoppler-cpp-dev
msgid "PDF rendering library -- development files (CPP interface)"
msgstr "PDF-renderingbibliotek – utvecklingsfiler (CPP-gränssnitt)"

#. Description
#: Package: libpoppler-cpp-dev
msgid ""
