#. Summary
#: Package: libreoffice-math
msgid "office productivity suite -- equation editor"
msgstr "kontorsproduktivitetssvit -- ekvationsredigerare"

#. Description
#: Package: libreoffice-math
msgid "This package contains the equation editor component for LibreOffice."
msgstr ""
"Detta paket innehåller ekvationsredigeringskomponenten för LibreOffice."

#. Summary
#: Package: libreoffice-nlpsolver
msgid "\"Solver for Nonlinear Programming\" extension for LibreOffice"
msgstr "tillägget \"Solver for Nonlinear Programming\" för LibreOffice"

#. Description
#: Package: libreoffice-nlpsolver
msgid ""
"By default LibreOffice Calc ships with a solver engine for linear "
"programming only. This allows the optimization of models to a certain "
"degree. However, if the formulas or constraints become more complex, "
"nonlinear programming is required. That missing gap is now filled by the "
"Solver for Nonlinear Programming extension."
msgstr ""
"Som standard levereras LibreOffice Calc med en lösningsmotor endast för "
"linjär programmering. Detta möjliggör optimering av modeller i viss "
"utsträckning. Om formlerna eller begränsningarna blir mer komplexa krävs "
"dock icke-linjär programmering. Denna lucka fylls nu av tillägget Solver for"
" Nonlinear Programming."

#. Description
#: Package: libreoffice-nlpsolver
msgid ""
"Currently it incorporates two Evolutionary Algorithms which are able to "
"handle floating point and integer variables as well as nonlinear "
"constraints."
msgstr ""
"För närvarande innehåller den två evolutionära algoritmer som kan hantera "
"flyttals- och heltalvariabler samt icke-linjära begränsningar."

#. Summary
#: Package: libreoffice-officebean
msgid "transitional package for libofficebean-java"
msgstr "övergångspaket för libofficebean-java"

#. Description
#: Package: libreoffice-officebean
msgid ""
"This package formerly contained binaries for the the LibreOffice Office Bean"
" for embedding LibreOffice in custom Java applications."
msgstr ""
"Detta paket innehöll tidigare binärfiler för LibreOffice Office Bean för "
"inbäddning av LibreOffice i anpassade Java-applikationer."

#. Description
#: Package: libreoffice-officebean
msgid ""
"This has now been merged into libofficebean-java so this package can safely "
"be removed."
msgstr ""
"Detta har nu slås samman med libofficebean-java, så detta paket kan säkert "
"tas bort."

#. Summary
#: Package: libreoffice-style-colibre
