#. Summary
#: Package: libvirt-daemon-hwe Package: libvirt-daemon
msgid "virtualization daemon"
msgstr "virtualiseringsdemon"

#. Description
#: Package: libvirt-daemon-hwe Package: libvirt-daemon
msgid ""
"This package contains the libvirtd daemon, which needs to run on the "
"hypervisor host."
msgstr ""
"Detta paket innehåller demonen libvirtd, som måste köras på "
"hypervisorvärden."

#. Description
#: Package: libvirt-daemon-hwe Package: libvirt-daemon
msgid ""
"Note that the daemon doesn't do anything useful on its own: connection "
"drivers (e.g. libvirt-daemon-driver-qemu) have to be installed to give it "
"the ability to create domains using various virtualization technologies, "
"while secondary drivers (e.g. libvirt-daemon-driver-network) make it capable"
" of managing other related resources."
msgstr ""
"Observera att demonen inte gör något användbart på egen hand: "
"anslutningsdrivrutiner (t.ex. libvirt-daemon-driver-qemu) måste installeras "
"för att den ska kunna skapa domäner med olika virtualiseringstekniker, medan"
" sekundära drivrutiner (t.ex. libvirt-daemon-driver-network) gör att den kan"
" hantera andra relaterade resurser."

#. Summary
#: Package: libvirt-daemon-lock-hwe Package: libvirt-daemon-lock
