msgstr "wayland Compositor Infrastructure – serverbibliotek"

#. Description
#: Package: libwayland-server0 Package: libwayland-egl1 Package:
#: libwayland-egl-backend-dev Package: libwayland-doc Package: libwayland-dev
#: Package: libwayland-cursor0 Package: libwayland-client0 Package:
#: libwayland-bin
msgid ""
"Wayland is a protocol for a compositor to talk to its clients as well as a C"
" library implementation of that protocol. The compositor can be a standalone"
" display server running on Linux kernel modesetting and evdev input devices,"
" an X application, or a wayland client itself. The clients can be "
"traditional applications, X servers (rootless or fullscreen) or other "
"display servers."
msgstr ""
"Wayland är ett protokoll för en kompositör att kommunicera med sina klienter"
" samt en C-biblioteksimplementering av det protokollet. Kompositören kan "
"vara en fristående bildskärmserver som körs på Linux-kärnans modesetting och"
" evdev-inmatningsenheter, en X-applikation eller en Wayland-klient i sig. "
"Klienterna kan vara traditionella applikationer, X-servrar (rootless eller "
"helskärm) eller andra bildskärmservrar."

