"https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libXrandr"
msgstr ""
"Denna modul finns på https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libXrandr"

#. Summary
#: Package: libxrender-dev
msgid "X Rendering Extension client library (development files)"
msgstr "X Rendering Extension-klientbibliotek (utvecklingsfiler)"

#. Description
#: Package: libxrender-dev Package: libxft-dev
msgid "This package provides a static library and C header files."
msgstr "Detta paket innehåller ett statiskt bibliotek och C-huvudfiler."

#. Summary
#: Package: libxrender1
msgid "X Rendering Extension client library"
msgstr "X Rendering Extension-klientbibliotek"

#. Description
#: Package: libxrender1 Package: libxrender-dev
msgid ""
"The X Rendering Extension (Render) introduces digital image composition as "
"the foundation of a new rendering model within the X Window System. "
"Rendering geometric figures is accomplished by client-side tessellation into"
" either triangles or trapezoids.  Text is drawn by loading glyphs into the "
"server and rendering sets of them.  The Xrender library exposes this "
"extension to X clients."
msgstr ""
"X Rendering Extension (Render) introducerar digital bildkomposition som "
"grund för en ny renderingsmodell inom X Window System. Rendering av "
"geometriska figurer åstadkoms genom tessellering på klientsidan till "
"antingen trianglar eller trapetser. Text ritas genom att glyfer laddas in i "
"servern och renderas i uppsättningar. Xrender-biblioteket exponerar denna "
"förlängning för X-klienter."

#. Description
#: Package: libxrender1 Package: libxrender-dev
msgid ""
"This module can be found at "
"git://anongit.freedesktop.org/git/xorg/lib/libXrender"
msgstr ""
"Denna modul finns på git://anongit.freedesktop.org/git/xorg/lib/libXrender"

